/ spdm-indirect.index (key 0) is a tstr rather than [1*64 uint], so it is
  shadowed into the map's `* int => any` catch-all. Without the check the
  measurement would resolve to no SPDM block indexes at all — silently
  under-verified instead of rejected. /
571({
  / ev-triples / 0: {
    / evidence-triples / 0: [
      [
        / environment-map / {
          / class / 0: { / vendor / 1: "TestVendor", / model / 2: "TestDirectAndIndirect" }
        },
        [
          { / mval / 1: { / digests / 2: [ [1, h'1111222233334444555566667777888899990000aaaabbbbccccddddeeeeffff'] ] } },
          { / mval / 1: { / spdm-indirect / 12: { / index: tstr, not [1*64 uint] / 0: "bad" } } }
        ]
      ]
    ]
  }
})
